My[ thankful] journal[ is] simply a little leather-bound book where I record the gifts God has given me[.] Eucharist[o]. Thanks. One Thousand Gifts. 10,000 reasons. Why write them down? Because I dare[ not] forget the goodness of God. In the remembering and the acknowledging I am overwhelmed with reassurance[ that] God[ is] my provider, comforter, healer, friend, joy, strength, and so much more. I[ am much less] likely to lose my focus and wander if I am remembering God's deeds and giving thanks.
